  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEO: Empowering Educators for a Green Future</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to implement an educational program in collaboration between the British Embassy and Georgian Renewable Energy Development Association, targeting teachers across Georgia to enhance their knowledge of renewable energy and environmental protection. Building on Georgian Renewable Energy Development Association&apos;s 2022 project experience, which educated over 1,000 high school students with USAID support, this initiative seeks to empower educators with accurate and comprehensive knowledge. The program will involve workshops in 10 Georgian regions, focusing on civics and geography teachers who directly engage with youth.</narrative>
  </description>
